{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12110340.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12110340","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1211034001:0":{"text":"열쇠 3개를 다 모았어. 어떤 보물이 나올지 모르겠네. 너희는 뭘 원해?","source_cn":"三把钥匙齐活啦，不知道能获得怎样的宝物，你们几个都想要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2C9D479EF7CCCDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211034002:1":{"text":"내가 원하는 건 신이 줄 수 없어.","source_cn":"我想要的东西，神明不可能给我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED9D944E2D595774","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211034003:0":{"text":"언니랑 영원히 함께하는 것. 하지만 이미 이룬 것 같아!","source_cn":"我想和姐姐永远在一起，但我已经得到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC99FA36AAF4D640E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211034004:0":{"text":"나라...","source_cn":"奈拉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6B306E1058EF939","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211034005:0":{"text":"저는 바라는 게 없고, 마스터가 원래의 힘과 기억을 되찾기를 바라요.","source_cn":"我没什么想要的，我只想主人找回属于自己的记忆和力量。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x59CAF25663E0007D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"저는 바라는 게 없고, 마스터가 원래의 힘과 기억을 되찾기를 바라요.","female":"저는 바라는 게 없고, 마스터가 원래의 힘과 기억을 되찾기를 바라요.","variant_male_record_index":"129476","variant_female_record_index":"129477","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211034006:0":{"text":"치피, 얄미워...","source_cn":"满满真狡猾……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC5ABF9770801DDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211034007:0":{"text":"오잉, 왜?","source_cn":"诶，为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87DA691631941B84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211034008:1":{"text":"왜냐하면, 왜냐하면! 그렇게 말하면 내 소원이 너무 이기적인 것 같잖아. 나는 마스터의 가장 자랑스러운 서머너가 되고 싶단 말이야!","source_cn":"因为、因为这样会显得我的愿望很自私。因为我想成为梅林最...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x503F46EC81EE2D4B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"왜냐하면, 왜냐하면! 그렇게 말하면 내 소원이 너무 이기적인 것 같잖아. 나는 마스터의 가장 자랑스러운 서머너가 되고 싶단 말이야!","female":"왜냐하면, 왜냐하면! 그렇게 말하면 내 소원이 너무 이기적인 것 같잖아. 나는 마스터의 가장 자랑스러운 서머너가 되고 싶단 말이야!","variant_male_record_index":"129480","variant_female_record_index":"129481","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1211034009:0":{"text":"마스터는 뭘 원하세요?","source_cn":"梅林，你想要什么呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x401CDD85AB06A4D2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터는 뭘 원하세요?","female":"마스터는 뭘 원하세요?","variant_male_record_index":"129482","variant_female_record_index":"129483","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1211034010":{"text":"이해해, 역시 산더미 같은 금은보화보다 좋은 건 없지!","source_cn":"梅林，你想要什么呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEA263B0C8F93D9C3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이해해, 역시 산더미 같은 금은보화보다 좋은 건 없지!","female":"이해해, 역시 산더미 같은 금은보화보다 좋은 건 없지!","variant_male_record_index":"129484","variant_female_record_index":"129485","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211034010:0":{"text":"이해해, 역시 산더미 같은 금은보화보다 좋은 건 없지!","source_cn":"我懂，最好是堆积如山的黄金！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEA263B0C8F93D9C3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이해해, 역시 산더미 같은 금은보화보다 좋은 건 없지!","female":"이해해, 역시 산더미 같은 금은보화보다 좋은 건 없지!","variant_male_record_index":"129484","variant_female_record_index":"129485","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1211034013:0":{"text":"이제 처음 우리가 있던 섬에 가서 비석에 타일을 올려두면 되는 건가?","source_cn":"接下来，是不是该回到一开始的小岛，将石板放回石碑上？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5858AF30346DB33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1211034014:0":{"text":"맞아. 돌아가려면 배를 타야 해. 배는 아직 함정 보물상자가 있는 곳에 있어. 가자!","source_cn":"没错，要回去的话得坐船，船还停在陷阱宝箱那里。走吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6632D62F8EADD0F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"금은보화가 갖고 싶어","source_cn":"想要财宝","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBB1F9DF7C722CF4D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"금은보화가 갖고 싶어","female":"금은보화가 갖고 싶어","variant_male_record_index":"65364","variant_female_record_index":"65365","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1211034011:0":{"text":"힘... 그리고 권력인가? 나쁘진 않지만, 너무 지루하군.","source_cn":"力量……和权力？那些是不错，但是没意思。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7C57FE947F9CCF33","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"힘... 그리고 권력인가? 나쁘진 않지만, 너무 지루하군.","female":"힘... 그리고 권력인가? 나쁘진 않지만, 너무 지루하군.","variant_male_record_index":"129486","variant_female_record_index":"129487","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:1:2":{"text":"강해지는 방법을 원해","source_cn":"想要变强的方法","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF1EC187B4CE2EBC8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"강해지는 방법을 원해","female":"강해지는 방법을 원해","variant_male_record_index":"65366","variant_female_record_index":"65367","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1211034012:0":{"text":"조금만 참아. 일단 보물을 손에 넣고, 러스트 항으로 돌아갈 방법을 생각해 보자.","source_cn":"坚持坚持嘛，先拿到宝藏，再想办法回锈锚港。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4D95C2B00B744E77","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"조금만 참아. 일단 보물을 손에 넣고, 러스트 항으로 돌아갈 방법을 생각해 보자.","female":"조금만 참아. 일단 보물을 손에 넣고, 러스트 항으로 돌아갈 방법을 생각해 보자.","variant_male_record_index":"129488","variant_female_record_index":"129489","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:2:3":{"text":"피곤해, 그냥 쉬고 싶어","source_cn":"累了，只想休息","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9C229626E58B7581","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"피곤해, 그냥 쉬고 싶어","female":"피곤해, 그냥 쉬고 싶어","variant_male_record_index":"65368","variant_female_record_index":"65369","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"소니아","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奈拉":{"text":"나라","source":"奈拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":5}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12111010.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12111010","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12111010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1211101001:0":{"text":"신밧드, 왜 그래?","source_cn":"辛巴达，怎么不往前走了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6478A3036D1330C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211101002:0":{"text":"안개가 너무 짙어... 아니면 조금 기다렸다가 다시 바다로 나가는 게 어때?","source_cn":"好浓的雾啊……要不，咱们还是晚点再出海吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BB13B96823DC12A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211101003:0":{"text":"러스트 항 근처의 짙은 안개에 비하면 이곳 날씨는 그리 나쁜 편이 아니야.","source_cn":"与锈锚港附近的浓雾相比，这里的天气不算恶劣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7259B85DCD58A685","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211101004:0":{"text":"아, 알아... 내 말은 여기까지 왔으니, 돌다리도 두드려보고 건너자는 말이지.","source_cn":"我、我知道……但我的意思是，都到这一步了，小心驶得万年船嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA0E6EBC2A399F80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211101005:0":{"text":"왜, 무서워?","source_cn":"你害怕了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31C39BB52794D29C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211101006:0":{"text":"아니거든.","source_cn":"我可没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EFF3C4A87FCE4E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211101007:0":{"text":"그런데 손은 떨고 있네?","source_cn":"可你的手在发抖。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90C270B1C24429FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211101008:0":{"text":"이게 무서워? 신밧드 겁쟁이네!","source_cn":"这都怕？辛巴达是胆小鬼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE0890EFD8AB86E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211101009:0":{"text":"신밧드, 네가 키를 잡아. 내가 조수 역할을 할게.","source_cn":"辛巴达，你来掌舵，我给你当副手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AB0EC12CC3F533A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1211101010:0":{"text":"네가 조수 역할을 하겠다고?","source_cn":"你要当副手？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4DB32BA824C780E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211101011:0":{"text":"그래. 항해 중에 적을 만나면 내가 해결할 테니까.","source_cn":"是啊，如果航行中遇到了敌人，我来应付。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C21C7FE7B2C98B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211101012:0":{"text":"네가 선뜻 조수를 하겠다고 말하다니... 의외인걸?","source_cn":"我的意思是……你竟然愿意给我当副手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54F82658DB72F2DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1211101013:0":{"text":"오해하지 마. 그냥 네 선장 놀이에 맞춰주려고 했던 것뿐이니까.","source_cn":"别想太多了。我只是心血来潮，想陪你玩玩扮演船长的游戏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD11A7230E75F20F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1211101014:0":{"text":"오는 내내 꽤 선장다운 모습을 보였잖아?","source_cn":"这一路上，你不是很有船长的风范吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1CB8A8E6FEDC0C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1211101015:0":{"text":"선장이라... 내가 정말 선장이 될 수 있을까?","source_cn":"船长……我真的能当船长吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD46AA2256A4F26AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1211101015":{"text":"선장이라... 내가 정말 선장이 될 수 있을까?","source_cn":"船长……我真的能当船长吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD46AA2256A4F26AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1211101016:0":{"text":"좋아, 너까지 그렇게 말한다면야.","source_cn":"是吗，既然你都这么说了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x013BD273600461E6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"좋아, 너까지 그렇게 말한다면야.","female":"좋아, 너까지 그렇게 말한다면야.","variant_male_record_index":"129948","variant_female_record_index":"129949","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1211101019:0":{"text":"좋아... 난 준비 됐어.","source_cn":"好……我准备好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF20955038160874","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1211101020:0":{"text":"선원들이여! 지금부터 이 신밧드 선장의 호령을 들으라!","source_cn":"水手们！从现在起，要听辛巴达船长的号令！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE131DD9AC766D259","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1211101021:0":{"text":"짙은 안개를 뚫고! 보물이 있는 곳으로 간다!","source_cn":"我们要冲破迷雾！抵达宝藏的所在！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0CE1CE3814F145A","variant_status":"","male":